{"4461460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fantasy Blacksmith Simulator", "steam_appid": 4461460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OPEN YOUR OWN FORGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4461460/extras/7715ca75c8b4e639719d642ecc13f540.poster.avif?t=1785164671\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4461460/extras/7715ca75c8b4e639719d642ecc13f540.webm?t=1785164671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4461460/extras/7715ca75c8b4e639719d642ecc13f540.mp4?t=1785164671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The workshop is open! Wipe away the dust, grab your hammer, and transform this space into a cozy smithy. Supply the kingdom's heroes with the finest gear in the land.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE ART OF STEEL AND MAGIC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4461460/extras/5f8621df978fa2b29ccee38f973deed4.poster.avif?t=1785164671\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4461460/extras/5f8621df978fa2b29ccee38f973deed4.webm?t=1785164671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4461460/extras/5f8621df978fa2b29ccee38f973deed4.mp4?t=1785164671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft masterful swords and sturdy armor, then infuse them with powerful spells – every dragon in the area will fear the knights wielding your weapons!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4461460/extras/f69e908f464466cc70987a4b14739521.poster.avif?t=1785164671\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4461460/extras/f69e908f464466cc70987a4b14739521.webm?t=1785164671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4461460/extras/f69e908f464466cc70987a4b14739521.mp4?t=1785164671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the cozy fantasy world as you descend into the Forgotten Mines or wander through the Magic Glade in search of precious metals, radiant gems, and rare magic wood. Turn rare finds into priceless masterpieces.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRAFT WITH FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4461460/extras/e8c37f91cc56b2be4e802c61dcd6a0f4.poster.avif?t=1785164671\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4461460/extras/e8c37f91cc56b2be4e802c61dcd6a0f4.webm?t=1785164671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4461460/extras/e8c37f91cc56b2be4e802c61dcd6a0f4.mp4?t=1785164671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work flows faster together! While one person pumps the bellows and melts the ore, another enchants the finished gear. Become a team of skillful blacksmiths capable of tackling any challenge that comes your way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE YOUR FORGE AND SHOP</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4461460/extras/690a58865d4521300ae2a5d400883ac1.poster.avif?t=1785164671\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4461460/extras/690a58865d4521300ae2a5d400883ac1.webm?t=1785164671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4461460/extras/690a58865d4521300ae2a5d400883ac1.mp4?t=1785164671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Expand your shop and smithy. Unlock new workstations and enchantment tables through the progression tree. Fill your workshop with a vast collection of useful tools.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OPEN YOUR OWN FORGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4461460/extras/7715ca75c8b4e639719d642ecc13f540.poster.avif?t=1785164671\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4461460/extras/7715ca75c8b4e639719d642ecc13f540.webm?t=1785164671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4461460/extras/7715ca75c8b4e639719d642ecc13f540.mp4?t=1785164671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The workshop is open! Wipe away the dust, grab your hammer, and transform this space into a cozy smithy. Supply the kingdom's heroes with the finest gear in the land.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE ART OF STEEL AND MAGIC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4461460/extras/5f8621df978fa2b29ccee38f973deed4.poster.avif?t=1785164671\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4461460/extras/5f8621df978fa2b29ccee38f973deed4.webm?t=1785164671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4461460/extras/5f8621df978fa2b29ccee38f973deed4.mp4?t=1785164671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft masterful swords and sturdy armor, then infuse them with powerful spells – every dragon in the area will fear the knights wielding your weapons!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4461460/extras/f69e908f464466cc70987a4b14739521.poster.avif?t=1785164671\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4461460/extras/f69e908f464466cc70987a4b14739521.webm?t=1785164671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4461460/extras/f69e908f464466cc70987a4b14739521.mp4?t=1785164671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the cozy fantasy world as you descend into the Forgotten Mines or wander through the Magic Glade in search of precious metals, radiant gems, and rare magic wood. Turn rare finds into priceless masterpieces.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRAFT WITH FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4461460/extras/e8c37f91cc56b2be4e802c61dcd6a0f4.poster.avif?t=1785164671\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4461460/extras/e8c37f91cc56b2be4e802c61dcd6a0f4.webm?t=1785164671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4461460/extras/e8c37f91cc56b2be4e802c61dcd6a0f4.mp4?t=1785164671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work flows faster together! While one person pumps the bellows and melts the ore, another enchants the finished gear. Become a team of skillful blacksmiths capable of tackling any challenge that comes your way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE YOUR FORGE AND SHOP</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4461460/extras/690a58865d4521300ae2a5d400883ac1.poster.avif?t=1785164671\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4461460/extras/690a58865d4521300ae2a5d400883ac1.webm?t=1785164671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4461460/extras/690a58865d4521300ae2a5d400883ac1.mp4?t=1785164671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Expand your shop and smithy. Unlock new workstations and enchantment tables through the progression tree. Fill your workshop with a vast collection of useful tools.</p>", "short_description": "Become a Master Blacksmith in this cozy fantasy simulator. Restore and upgrade your workshop, forge magical weapons and armor, craft jewelry, and enchant powerful gear. Meet magical creatures and mysterious figures as you enjoy a relaxing crafting experience, solo or with friends in co-op.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4461460/baf98585e8063106b5f0cf68ff17544cbfe9109e/header.jpg?t=1785164671", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4461460/005664e4583096796175e743af7c61a4a488b4c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785164671", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4461460/005664e4583096796175e743af7c61a4a488b4c5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785164671", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD FX-6300 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 960 4GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX-compatible sound device<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Microphone recommended for voice chat</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9600K / AMD Ryzen 5 3600 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 960 4GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br